   "subject": "Re: bfactor() with loadings only on general factor",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "New option added to allow for dropping specific factors internally by using NA&#39;s in place of numeric input. Update is on github and ?bfactor contains a new example specifically for this."
    ],
